#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:4
msgid "圆形显示"
msgstr "circular display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:9
msgid ""
"圆形显示节点用于在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制圆形标记，特别适合标注点状目标、关键点或需要突出显示的区域中心。该节点支持多种颜色方案、自定义样式和灵活的配置选项，可以清晰地展示关键点检测、目标中心定位等模型的预测结果。"
msgstr ""
"The Circle Display node is used to draw circular markers around detected "
"objects in the image. It is particularly suitable for marking point targets,"
" key points, or the center of an area that needs to be highlighted.This node"
" supports multiple color schemes, custom styles and flexible configuration "
"options, and can clearly display the prediction results of models such as "
"key point detection and target center positioning."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:11
msgid "效果展示："
msgstr "Effect display:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:12
msgid "Circle Visualization Example"
msgstr "Circle Visualization Example"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:18
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Applicable scenarios"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:20
msgid "**关键点检测可视化**：显示检测到的人体关键点、面部特征点等"
msgstr ""
"**Visualization of key point detection**: Displays the detected key points "
"of the human body, facial feature points, etc."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:21
msgid "**目标中心标注**：标记检测对象的中心位置"
msgstr ""
"**Target center marking**: mark the center position of the detection object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:22
msgid "**点状目标检测**：显示小型目标或兴趣点"
msgstr ""
"**Point Object Detection**: Display small targets or points of interest"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:23
msgid "**轨迹追踪**：标记追踪目标的当前位置"
msgstr "**Track Tracking**: Mark the current location of the tracking target"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:24
msgid "**数据标注验证**：验证关键点预测结果的准确性"
msgstr ""
"**Data annotation verification**: Verify the accuracy of key point "
"prediction results"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:25
msgid "**调试分析**：辅助开发者理解模型输出"
msgstr "**Debug Analysis**: Assist developers in understanding model output"

