msgid "``2``"
msgstr "``2``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:81
msgid "参数详细说明"
msgstr "Detailed description of parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:85
msgid "**True**：创建图像副本，原始图像保持不变，可用于后续其他可视化"
msgstr ""
"**True**: A copy of the image is created, the original image remains "
"unchanged and can be used for other subsequent visualizations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:86
msgid "**False**：直接在原图上绘制，节省内存但会修改原图"
