"**False**: Draw directly on the original image, saving memory but modifying "
"the original image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:90
msgid "支持多种调色板方案："
msgstr "Supports multiple color palette schemes:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:92
