msgstr "``DEFAULT``: system default color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:93
msgid "``MATPLOTLIB``：使用Matplotlib的颜色方案"
msgstr "``MATPLOTLIB``: Use Matplotlib's color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:94
msgid "``CUSTOM``：使用自定义颜色列表（需配置Custom Colors参数）"
msgstr ""
"``CUSTOM``: Use a custom color list (need to configure the Custom Colors "
"parameter)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:98
msgid "当选择自定义颜色时，使用HEX格式定义颜色列表："
msgstr "When selecting custom colors, define the color list using HEX format:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:104
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同的类别。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple, the colors will be "
"assigned to different categories in order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:106
msgid "**颜色坐标轴(在CUSTOM模式下会被忽略)**"
msgstr "**Color axis (ignored in CUSTOM mode)**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:108
msgid "``CLASS``：根据物体类别着色，同类物体使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to object category, similar objects use the same "
"color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:109
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个物体分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: assign a different color to each object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/circle_display.rst:110
msgid "``TRACK``：根据Tracker ID着色，每个Tracker ID使用不同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``TRACK``: Colored according to Tracker ID, use different colors for each "
"Tracker ID"
